# Text files are normalised to LF in the repository and checked out with native
# line endings. Everything listed below is exempt from that conversion.
* text=auto

# SOLIDWORKS macros are OLE compound binaries. Line-ending conversion would
# corrupt them silently - git usually detects binary content on its own, but
# these files are too important to leave to detection.
*.swp binary
*.swb binary

# Images and other binaries
*.png binary
*.bmp binary
*.ico binary
*.psd binary
*.msi binary
*.dll binary
